				<article
class="post-15 page type-page status-publish ast-article-single" id="post-15" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" itemscope="itemscope">
	
	
<div class="entry-content clear"
	itemprop="text">

	
			<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="15" class="elementor elementor-15">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0899f1 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-default-div e-2abba4b " data-id="e0899f1" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0899f1">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0331e37 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="0331e37" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a467cc6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="a467cc6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h5 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">20 November 2026 - We're not the ones full of s**t </h5>				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c04d1ec e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-default-div e-4522604 " data-id="c04d1ec" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="c04d1ec">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6dc4435 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="6dc4435" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b77f58b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="b77f58b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
																<a href="https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-scaled.jpg" target="_blank">
							<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="768" height="576" src="https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-768x576.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-4868" alt="" srcset="https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-2048x1536.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" />								</a>
															</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-24f03cb e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-default-div e-0f7edae " data-id="24f03cb" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="24f03cb">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d95ab0e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="d95ab0e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8b2be7e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8b2be7e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>A big shout-out to Active for coming down to empty the tanks on our solar powered green energy toilet block. They’re a brilliant local company with super-friendly professional staff. All waste is dealt with enviromentally. Thanks to them, we’re now officially no longer full of s**t!</p><p>This winter we’ll be working on our solar-powered toilet block, upgrading and adding solar-powered showers so sea swimmers and kitesurfers can rinse off after a session in the water.</p><p>Our toilets and baby-changing facilities were a big hit with people visiting Goring Gap throughout the summer. Scroll down to see our facilities alongside the public toilets and baby-changing provision maintained by Worthing Borough Council.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c1de43a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-default-div e-98f133e " data-id="c1de43a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="c1de43a">
