							<img decoding="async" width="300" height="225" src="https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-3-300x225.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-4870" alt="" srcset="https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-3-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-3-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-3-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-3-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://www.goringgap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Active-3-2048x1536.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" />								</a>
